# SDD governance

Read: `docs/SDD-DEVELOPMENT.md`, `docs/SESSION-PROTOCOL.md`, `.cursorrules`.

## Spec first

1. Identify specs: AGENTS.md table → open `docs/PHASES/NN-*.md`
2. If behavior undefined → update spec/schema/ADR **before** code
3. Implementation must match PRODUCT, DATA-MODEL, domain docs, `docs/schemas/`

## Session end

Cite specs satisfied + PHASES exit checklist. Not "done" on code alone.

## Default scope

Do not scaffold app or add tooling unless user explicitly requests in this task.

Validation: manual `docs/SPEC-VALIDATION.md` (optional `npm run validate:*`).
